      "dedupe_key": "johns-boys-welsh-male-voice-choir|2027-07-16|union-chapel",
      "description": "Experience the unmistakable sound of Johns’ Boys Welsh Male Voice Choir in the extraordinary surroundings of London’s iconic Union Chapel. Johns' Boys made history as the first and only British male voice choir to win the prestigious Pavarotti Choir of the World title at the Llangollen International Musical Eisteddfod. Since then, the choir have appeared on Britain's Got Talent, The Royal Variety Performance, BBC's Last Night of the Proms and Netflix's Stay Close, captivating audiences with their rich harmonies, musical excellence and distinctive Welsh sound. Renowned for combining the proud tradition of Welsh male voice singing with fresh, contemporary arrangements, Johns' Boys present a programme of soaring harmonies, beloved hymns, traditional Welsh favourites and modern classics. Every performance is delivered with passion, warmth and exceptional musicianship, creating an unforgettable concert experience that has captivated audiences across the UK and beyond. Join Johns' Boys for a very special London concert in one of the capital's most atmospheric venues, celebrating the very best of Welsh choral music. With recent concerts selling out across the UK, early booking is strongly recommended.",
      "ends_at": null,
