      "description": "Union Chapel Church hosts a special service for Remembrance Sunday, featuring a traditional act of remembrance and a special performance of Faure’s Requiem sung by Eclectic Voices and Highbury Youth Choir. Scott Stroman directs the beautiful music, wound through the service, with a chamber ensemble of violin, cello, harp and organ. All are welcome",
